Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty-Second Episode\NThe Royal Wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.54,0:01:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Before starting\Ntoday's episode,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,let's briefly summarize\Nthe previous episodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin, having become\Nan agent of the powerful Union X,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.42,0:02:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,pushes his petty ambition..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,..to the point of trying to kill\Nthe King, the Queen, and Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But the schemer\Nwill not succeed in his intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He will die a sudden death,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,due to the betrayal of\Nhis assistant, Baron Nylon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.26,0:02:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,who seizes the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon receives the\NUnion X army in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.22,0:02:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile Sapphire is saying goodbye\Nto her parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.94,0:02:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,locked in the room\Nof skeletons,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and with three spheres of gold,\Nsilver and copper,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,which are believed to have the power to\Nprotect the kingdom of Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,she flees from the castle\Nand runs towards Goldland,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to ask for help\Nfrom Prince Franz, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.26,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What power will\Nthese three spheres have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.54,0:02:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any power,\Nmagic spheres, help me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Sapphire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven,\NI will do anything for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But you, help Sapphire, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NWhat is this sound of bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You have truly gone mad, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to tell you about the bells!\NThey are being rung by the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.90,0:04:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,who are lamenting because\Nthe King and Queen are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!\NDestroy all the bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.74,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And find Sapphire\Nas soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it be on a mountain,\Nvalley, village... anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If it is necessary,\Ndestroy the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy all the places where it is\Npossible that Sapphire is hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our poor old city!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Union X has destroyed everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But you see that Sapphire\Nwill defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has lost\Nher father and mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but she has Prince Frank with her
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, there is a surprise!\NBut first blindfold your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.26,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Check that everything is in order,\Nold owl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, get ready, fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What you are about to see is a gift\Nfor you from your forest friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take off your blindfolds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s truly delightful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, do you like the gift\Nthat we are giving you from the heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it very much!\NYou have been so kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m glad you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, keep watching:\Nthere is another gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forest friends,\NI’m sorry if I wandered away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me,\Nbut I feel so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I am trying to fight back,\Nbut I always feel a great sadness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I always feel like crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How much I would like to see\Nmy father and my mother again..!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.18,0:08:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We understand you, Sapphire,\Nand we also suffer so much with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father,\NI will do whatever you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I beg you,\Ngrant my wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.14,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, heavenly Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give Sapphire back\Nher father and her mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them back to life for her!\NGrant my wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! I won't ask you\Nfor anything else, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Heavenly Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, once you were an angel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.14,0:08:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but your wishes cannot\Nbe easily granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.38,0:09:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to help\Nthose you love,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you will have to sacrifice yourself to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will see how many sacrifices\Nyou will have faced for them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will decide whether to grant\Nyour wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I will work for Sapphire!\NI will do anything for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so much good stuff! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.58,0:09:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sapphire will\Nbe very happy about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are these?\NWho brought them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that you\Nfound them, little mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.90,0:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,\Nbut they aren't edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! They could serve\Nas a clapper for our bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.46,0:09:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That way I'll wake up Sapphire!\NOh, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, these three spheres\Nare very precious to Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.06,0:09:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But couldn't you leave\Nthem with me for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.18,0:09:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ring the bells\Nand wake up Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be careful not to\Nbreak them, don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, Opal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Now let's hear how they sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.70,0:10:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The bells are ringing by themselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hang the spheres\Ninside the bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.74,0:10:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that those three spheres\Nhave great magical power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Those three spheres\Nwill protect Silverland,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the Royal Family and the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- These are the bells!\N- What? - Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The bells! The bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.14,0:11:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you\Nto destroy all the bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your order\Nhas been carried out, master!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This sound...\NMy head hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deafening me! Go and destroy\Nthese ringing bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The broken bells\Nare moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.82,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms\Nfeel like fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I also feel\Nfull of energy again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.06,0:11:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, let's fight!\NLet's drive X away! Let's all fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The bells are performing\Nthe miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic bells are for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's attack the army\Nof Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, let's fight!\N- Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Bell, ring louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid they are! They\Nwill never defeat us! Advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, destroy them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurrah! Hooray! Victory! Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Sapphire, the spheres are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Let's take shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NWe've locked ourselves in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I know\Nthe way out of this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We will come out near the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a stroke of luck!\NI could get into the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and try to kill X!\NPlease, look for a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need is a weapon, that\Nway we can retake the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it: let's build it\Nwith the three spheres!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Right! We are the\Nbest blacksmiths in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true! It seems\Nlike a good idea to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is the one who has the three\Nspheres. But where is he? Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.14,0:15:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink! Tink!\N- Tink, where are you? Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, they are so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! We were\Nlooking for you! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying to build a\Nweapon with these three spheres.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the thought, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will show you what\Ngreat blacksmiths we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- It looks like a magic weapon!\N- Here you go, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it? A trumpet?!\N- That trumpet must have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.42,0:16:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...the same power as the bells!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.30,0:16:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it with\Nthe leftover gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wait here, please!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back! I'll\Ntake care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.66,0:16:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A knight is approaching!\NIt's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you, Franz!\N- Throw the magic axe, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the magic power of the spheres!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to attack\Nthe army of Union X!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go! Go, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.10,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cursed Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.82,0:18:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! - Now I can avenge\Nmy parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.34,0:18:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven, don't let Sapphire die!\NPlease, help her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,X is dead, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.10,0:19:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the great X!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.50,0:20:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! Tink..! Don't die!\NPlease, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Father in heaven is calling me,\Nso now I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!\NYou will stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven, I have done\Neverything to help Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.06,0:20:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you grant\Nmy wish now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send Sapphire's father and mother\Nto Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I will send them in your place,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.30,0:20:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,while you will return to heaven,\Nbeside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavenly Father, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.02,0:21:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.86,0:21:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- My daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an angel once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.46,0:22:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,On Earth, since then,\Nmany years have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine that you, now,\Nwill want to know what became...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...of the kingdom of Silverland,\Nof Sapphire and Franz, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.10,0:22:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see! Silverland has\Nregained its former beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.46,0:22:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and everyone leads a happy life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Sapphire,\Nare you ready to go out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!\NI'm more than ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see that Sapphire and\NFranz will marry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they will be\Na beautiful couple!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They will live happily all their lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.14,0:23:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will ask the Heavenly\NFather to be able to attend...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.46,0:23:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...their wedding.
